{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"d1e66cf0e725f28d2a3d1ddd0aa2bdc9dcc221243b7ea7a1d11fa1092f1ca98f","ja":"もしかして、いい霊？","zh":"难道是……好幽灵？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6ce486d0f90cddd497ec3e48ed21b434c780ca5892d27ced5f603936ba836558","ja":"「じゃじゃ～ん、ドッキリ大成功～！\n突然の暗闇のリアクション、最高でした！」","zh":"「锵锵～整蛊大获成功～！\n突然陷入黑暗时的反应真是太棒了！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"86d58704f3657f9034357879b9469cbf41e839e0082617f7ab4329071b7bb278","ja":"ええっ……ドッキリだったんですか～。\nよかった～……。","zh":"咦……原来是整蛊啊～。\n太好了～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"773fb3b744a99d35bebe007a342d20841299cef7769a6dfd9c3a4afc51e1eb91","ja":"え～、それじゃあ、強い力をもった\n霊みたいなものも、いないんですか？","zh":"咦～，这么说来，连拥有强大力量的\n恶灵之类的东西，也都没有吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5a434786138962dbc178facd385aed3d4ecde2a89d6164cd4c33c0a1bd26ef8d","ja":"「それは……本当に視えています。\nふたりを驚かせるな、と、なんだか怒っていますね」","zh":"“那个……真的能看见。\n对方好像还在生气，说着‘不要吓到那两个人’呢”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d232ef5fd43ea1b9fcbb9315b7e82c0deecbf16b01fe4d7699942a0548b2d743","ja":"そ、それじゃあ……\nお祓いなどに行った方がいいんでしょうか～……？","zh":"那、那么……\n是不是最好去驱个邪之类的呀～……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9f082c0d423fe12d23940f65c667d01a20418bb0bf8b4e89adb331f891a80113","ja":"「おふたりを応援？しているような雰囲気も\n感じるので、あまり気にされなくて大丈夫かと」","zh":"“也能感觉到有种在为两位加油？的气氛，\n我想您不用太放在心上。”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9344dd820f5424d63cbadf4f0e42658cb9ee1e4a26920b1eb97a218c01c4910f","ja":"そうなんですね～。……あずささん、大丈夫ですか？\n怖かったら、私の手を握っててくださいね♪","zh":"是这样啊～。……梓小姐，你没事吧？\n要是害怕的话，可以握着我的手哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"e457379dde4d7d74f6221a48ed7d70b4f5a0568782f8d0b8d90f528a9472ede8","ja":"うう、ありがとう麗花ちゃん……！　それであの……\nも、もう少し対処法など教えていただけると……。","zh":"呜呜，谢谢你丽花……！那个……\n要、要是能再多教教我应对的方法就……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f8a4ffe78e51b1467ecce0ccc5f9f0f1085f51cc96295f7fbed0c489cbaf8586","ja":"お疲れさまでした～♪","zh":"辛苦啦～♪","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"aa52e2375d2bd5150837b50df694c8d64a09c94042d88118a2af249b21e97587","ja":"きゃっ！？　あ、麗花ちゃん。\nごめんなさい、びっくりしちゃって。","zh":"呀！？啊，是丽花。\n不好意思，吓了我一跳。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"792d0dbe88a7215f2aa4011ee8b6936d729658ad0ae1c53d2fe9b93fb4466279","ja":"ダメね。私ったら、ずっとびくびくしてて。\nでも……麗花ちゃんはぜんぜん怖がってないのね。","zh":"真不行呢。我居然一直这么提心吊胆的。\n不过……丽花你完全不怕呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"978d6884d16a1b463498d480d30d78051676193ebf246e9a0941de1a204223b3","ja":"ん～……別に嫌な気配は感じないですし、\n気にしなくてもいいのかなって。","zh":"嗯～……倒也没感觉到什么不妙的动静，\n觉得不用太放在心上吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"200e3279e44d4f49fc52423c052cb171814f092d878fc54604c0dde57cab5a0d","ja":"あ……。\n確かに、不思議と嫌な感じはしないのよね……。","zh":"啊……。\n确实，不可思议的是并不让人觉得讨厌呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"8d723fd1407bd7b042c5170390c7d4213a6ea3e4b158c9ded25440b8f8b24179","ja":"さっき暗くなったのもドッキリで、\nおばけになにかされたわけじゃないし……。","zh":"刚才变暗也只是恶作剧，\n并不是被幽灵做了什么……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"f507b9c8a4bfda90843691b776bd70aff301888202cce1672ab110c8a2b1979e","ja":"霊能力者さんも、応援してくれてるって\n言ってたし、ファンの人みたいですよね。","zh":"通灵者也说过在支持我们，\n感觉就像是粉丝一样呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1703.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"55b343fda8e193018b083d5635f81b8f1981ecdcb8a65d5fcceec4c750605e8a","ja":"ええ。そう思うと、怖がりすぎるのもかわいそうね。\n……ごめんなさいね、おばけさん。","zh":"嗯。这么一想，太害怕它们也挺可怜的呢。\n……对不起哦，幽灵先生。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
